      "id": "11-09-source-018-card",
      "lesson": "11-09",
      "topics": [
        "Time",
        "Verbs",
        "Tenses"
      ],
      "front": "Must il y a + duration and dans + duration always end the sentence?",
      "back": "No. Both initial and final positions are possible: Il y a deux jours, je suis parti / Je suis parti il y a deux jours; Dans deux jours, je partirai.",
